\frametitle{The Acceptance Criterion}
The core logic dictates whether a proposed move is accepted or rejected based on the change in energy and the system temperature.

    \vspace{0.3cm}
    \begin{lstlisting}[language=Python]
# Metropolis acceptance criterion
if de <= 0 or np.random.rand() < np.exp(-de / kT):
    P = P_new # Accept the move
    accepted_moves += 1
else:
    # Reject the move, stay at current P
    pass
    \end{lstlisting}
